//   calls), the def's virtual slot 1 (+4) at a zero count. Globals: 1e-4f 0x0129BA3C, 0.2f 0x012305A0.
// Layout: CCombatTypeDef (PDB 0xC0; retail head 0x3C and three 12-byte STLport vectors, so 0x10 below the PDB from
